sequenceDiagram
  actor U as 用户
  participant UI as React / assistant-ui
  participant DB as IndexedDB
  participant API as Fastify API
  participant H as AntlerHostRuntime
  participant A as PiAgentAdapter
  participant P as LLM Provider
  participant T as Workspace / Skill / Search Tools

  UI->>DB: 读取会话与项目工作目录
  U->>UI: 提交消息
  UI->>API: POST /api/runs
  Note over UI,API: conversationId + provider + workingDirectory
  API->>H: createRunWithSkills()
  H->>H: 固化 SkillSnapshot<br/>检查会话并发与上下文指纹
  H-->>API: queued run
  API-->>UI: 202 runId + eventsUrl
  UI->>API: GET /api/runs/:runId/events
  API->>H: 补放 afterEventId 后的事件并订阅

  H-->>API: run.started
  API-->>UI: SSE run.started
  H->>A: run(input, conversationId, snapshot, signal)

  loop Pi 状态化 Agent 循环
    A->>P: 流式模型请求
    P-->>A: text / thinking / tool call
    A-->>H: Pi AgentEvent
    H-->>API: 映射为领域事件
    API-->>UI: SSE delta / step
    opt 模型调用工具
      A->>T: schema 校验后执行
      T-->>A: 结构化结果
      A-->>H: tool execution event
      H-->>API: tool.completed
      API-->>UI: SSE tool.completed
    end
  end

  A-->>H: Agent 完成或抛错
  H-->>API: run.completed / failed / cancelled
  API-->>UI: SSE 终态后关闭连接
  UI->>DB: 防抖保存完整消息快照

  opt 用户中止、超时或事件数超限
    UI->>API: POST /api/runs/:runId/cancel
    API->>H: AbortController.abort()
    H->>A: signal → agent.abort()
  end
